<title>USA: Applied Microbiology Q1 net loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Applied Microbiology Q1 net loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>TARRYTOWN, N.Y. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Microbiology Inc Q1 Sept 30 end</p>
<p>				     1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr loss			$ 0.22     loss	$ 0.06</p>
<p> Net loss			 4,385     loss	 1,096</p>
<p> Revs			     4,366		    2,251</p>
<p> Avg shrs outstanding	20,560		   18,181</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company attributed the net loss for the quarter primarily to the marketing investment spending in support of company products, Cardia and Wipe-Out, in addition to higher research costs in drug development.</p>
</text>
